flowchart TD
  I["IDEA+ / business and system requirements"] --> D["01 Define task and measurable result"]
  D --> C["02 Hard constraints, assets, risk matrix"]
  C --> B["03 C4 decomposition and owner"]
  B --> S["04 Library search: book, method, chapter and applicability"]
  S --> G{"Verified prior art?"}
  G -- No --> R["Research task / source and test gap"]
  R --> S
  G -- Yes --> A["05 Baseline + alternatives"]
  A --> H{"06 Hard constraints pass?"}
  H -- No --> A
  H -- Yes --> E["07 Measure fair benchmark / uncertain = NOT_MEASURED"]
  E --> ADR["08 Architecture Decision Record"]
  ADR --> CT["09 ALG + CMP + FLOW + API + SECURITY contracts"]
  CT --> DEV["10 Controlled implementation"]
  DEV --> TEST["11 Functional + adversarial + independent POLYGON"]
  TEST --> Q{"Qualified and approved by human?"}
  Q -- No --> FIX["Revise design and update threat matrix"] --> ADR
  Q -- Yes --> REL["12 Release, monitor, retrigger on change"]
